{"translation":{"id":"ory_irv","name":"ଇଣ୍ଡିୟାନ ରିୱାଇସ୍ଡ୍ ୱରସନ୍ ଓଡିଆ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=ory","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=ory","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Oriya Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"ory","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"fe09301e6f43dbbcfcb30753438997976ee983751a3278733f551d91025dee13","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ଓଡ଼ିଆ","languageEnglishName":"Odia"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"ory_irv","name":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","commonName":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","title":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"66539124e8124247ab4799343f0663cb93d027589d0e40219697891b1f630152","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":114,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ନିସ୍ତାର ପର୍ବ ସଙ୍ଗୀତ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ଯେତେବେଳେ ଇସ୍ରାଏଲ ମିସରରୁ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଓ ଯାକୁବ ବଂଶ ଅନ୍ୟ ଭାଷାବାଦୀ ଲୋକଙ୍କ ମଧ୍ୟରୁ ବାହାରିଲେ;","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସେତେବେଳେ ଯିହୁଦା ତାହାଙ୍କ ଧର୍ମଧାମ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଓ ଇସ୍ରାଏଲ ତାହାଙ୍କ ରାଜ୍ୟ ହେଲା,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସମୁଦ୍ର ତାହା ଦେଖି ପଳାଇଲା;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଯର୍ଦ୍ଦନ ଉଜାଣି ବହିଲା।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ପର୍ବତଗଣ ମେଷ ପରି","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଓ ଉପପର୍ବତଗଣ ମେଷଶାବକ ପରି ଡିଆଁ ମାରିଲେ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ତୁମ୍ଭର କʼଣ ହେଲା ଯେ, ହେ ସମୁଦ୍ର, ତୁମ୍ଭେ ପଳାଉଅଛ?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ହେ ଯର୍ଦ୍ଦନ, ତୁମ୍ଭେ ଉଜାଣି ବହୁଅଛ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ହେ ପର୍ବତଗଣ, ତୁମ୍ଭେମାନେ ମେଷ ପରି,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ହେ ଉପପର୍ବତଗଣ, ତୁମ୍ଭେମାନେ ମେଷଶାବକ ପରି ଡିଆଁ ମାରୁଅଛ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ହେ ପୃଥିବୀ, ତୁମ୍ଭେ ପ୍ରଭୁଙ୍କ ଛାମୁରେ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଯାକୁବର ପରମେଶ୍ୱରଙ୍କ ଛାମୁରେ କମ୍ପିତ ହୁଅ;","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ସେ ଶୈଳକୁ ଜଳାଶୟ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଚକ୍‍ମକି ପ୍ରସ୍ତରକୁ ନିର୍ଝର କଲେ।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/114.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/115.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/113.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}